    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"47\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2016/04/22/the-very-first-texture/rough_rock_001_render-2/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/rough_rock_001_render1.png?fit=840%2C494&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"840,494\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Rough_rock_001_RENDER\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/rough_rock_001_render1.png?fit=800%2C470&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-47\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/rough_rock_001_render1.png?resize=800%2C470&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Rough_rock_001_RENDER\" width=\"800\" height=\"470\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"47\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2016/04/22/the-very-first-texture/rough_rock_001_render-2/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/rough_rock_001_render1.png?fit=840%2C494&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"840,494\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Rough_rock_001_RENDER\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/rough_rock_001_render1.png?fit=800%2C470&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-47 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20840%20494%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"Rough_rock_001_RENDER\" width=\"840\" height=\"494\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/rough_rock_001_render1.png\"></p>\n<p>Hello my friends.</p>\n<p>Here it is, the very first texture of the blog. Let&#8217;s name it with the ubber original name of Rough_rock_001.</p>\n<p>Like ALL the textures that will be in this blog it&#8217;s seamless, this one is 1024 x 1024, and it&#8217;s composed of several maps that include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Diffuse</li>\n<li>Normal</li>\n<li>Displacement</li>\n<li>Specularity</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ambient Occlusion</li>\n</ul>\n<p><!--more--></p>\n<h2><strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1eKfzKMoHLKK_4zx0MIz74IHxftOQrgQA?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOWNLOAD ALL THE MAPS</a></strong></h2>\n<p><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"58\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2016/04/22/the-very-first-texture/textuure_passes/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/textuure_passes.png?fit=1024%2C1024&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1024,1024\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Textuure_passes\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/textuure_passes.png?fit=800%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-58\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/textuure_passes.png?resize=800%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Textuure_passes\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"58\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2016/04/22/the-very-first-texture/textuure_passes/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/textuure_passes.png?fit=1024%2C1024&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1024,1024\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Textuure_passes\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/textuure_passes.png?fit=800%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-58 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%201024%201024%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"Textuure_passes\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/textuure_passes.png\"></p>\n<p>You will have to download the maps one by one. If, for some reason, you would like<br>\nto access my folder containing all the textures with the possibility of download them all with a click consider giving me a little tip, using the right&nbsp;menu, and I&#8217;ll provide you the link for it.</p>\n<p>Keep an eye on the blog and on my <a href=\"https://twitter.com/ErenKatsukagi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">twitter</a> for more free textures goodies.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">Can&#8217;t find what you&#8217;re looking for? Take a look on what iStock has to offer.</h4>\n<p><a style=\"outline-width: 0px !important; user-select: auto !important;\" href=\"https://istockphoto.7eer.net/c/1397861/258824/4205?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.istockphoto.com%2Fpt%2Ffoto%2Fcarv%25C3%25A3o-gm509536520-85826801\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3712\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2016/04/22/the-very-first-texture/close-up-of-black-coal/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/istockphoto-509536520-612x612.jpg?fit=612%2C408&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"612,408\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Getty Images/iStockphoto&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Close-up of black coal&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Close-up of black coal&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Close-up of black coal\" data-image-description data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;Close-up of black coal&lt;/p&gt;\n\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/istockphoto-509536520-612x612.jpg?fit=612%2C408&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-thumbnail wp-image-3712\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/istockphoto-509536520-612x612.jpg?resize=150%2C100&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Close-up of black coal\" width=\"150\" height=\"10