54952214-612x612.jpg?resize=612%2C612&amp;ssl=1 612w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3715\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2016/04/22/the-very-first-texture/a-rough-rock-texture-background/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/istockphoto-154952214-612x612.jpg?fit=612%2C408&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"612,408\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Getty Images/iStockphoto&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;A rough rock texture background&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;A rough rock texture background&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"A rough rock texture background\" data-image-description data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;A rough rock texture background&lt;/p&gt;\n\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/istockphoto-154952214-612x612.jpg?fit=612%2C408&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-thumbnail wp-image-3715 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20150%20100%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"A rough rock texture background\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" srcset=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20150%20100%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" data-srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/istockphoto-154952214-612x612.jpg?resize=150%2C100&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/istockphoto-154952214-612x612.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/istockphoto-154952214-612x612.jpg?resize=180%2C120&amp;ssl=1 180w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/istockphoto-154952214-612x612.jpg?resize=612%2C612&amp;ssl=1 612w\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/istockphoto-15495